    Quote(id: 778, text: "Well, sir, it's this rug I had. It really tied the room together.", movie: "The Big Lebowski", year: 1998),
    Quote(id: 779, text: "Look, let me explain something to you. I'm not Mr. Lebowski. You're Mr. Lebowski. I'm the Dude. So that's what you call me. That, or His Dudeness, Duder or El Duderino, if you're not into the whole brevity thing.", movie: "The Big Lebowski", year: 1998),
