    Quote(id: 805, text: "The Matrix is arguably the ultimate cyberpunk artifact.", movie: "The Matrix", year: 1999),
    Quote(id: 806, text: "Written and directed by the Wachowski Brothers, Larry and Andy, \"The Matrix\" is the unlikely spiritual love child of dark futurist Philip K. Dick and the snap and dazzle of Hong Kong filmmaking, with digital technology serving as the helpful midwife.", movie: "The Matrix", year: 1999),
